# 作用：只允许容器需要的源码进入构建上下文，排除本机密钥、原始素材和日志。
**
!backend/
!backend/app/
!backend/app/**
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/cleanup_sessions.py
!backend/deploy/
!backend/deploy/docker/
!backend/deploy/docker/**
!frontend/
!frontend/*.html
!frontend/favicon.ico
!frontend/styles.css
!frontend/journey.css
!frontend/mine-journey.css
!frontend/mine-practice.css
!frontend/navigation.css
!frontend/styles/
!frontend/styles/**
!frontend/src/
!frontend/src/**
!frontend/assets/
!frontend/assets/**
# 明确排除测试和工具；Docker的*.html匹配不能用来隔离嵌套HTML夹具。
frontend/test/
frontend/test/**
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/package*.json
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
